\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Praise to our God, who with love never swerving
\par Gudes our endeavours, enfolds us from harm,
\par Peace and prosperity, past our deserving,
\par Showering upon us with bountiful arm.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Gone are the labours, the joy, and the sorrow;
\par Lo, at the end we draw near to adore,
\par Ere our full life is begun on the morrow,
\par Childhood behind us and manhood before.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Shepherd of souls, O door of salvation,
\par Keep Thou Thy flock in Thine infinite care,
\par Fold them as one in their last adoration,
\par Ere in the distance divided they fare.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Though never more in one place all may gather,
\par Though in life's battle we struggle apart,
\par One be our Saviour, and one be our Father,
\par Bind us together in faith and in heart.
\par Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

